      <activity id="d898088f-8a20-5a13-a733-feecb91e3389" activityNameId="cd7b3c6b-1d3d-57ba-a1de-649bcd2f5724" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">DAS-1, fluorescent whitening agent triazinylaminostilben type, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: DAS-1, fluorescent whitening agent triazinylaminostilben type, at plant
data based on company information for a former detergent study of EMPA;
CAS number: 016090-02-1; 
UUID: a4fa1bb7-e42e-3ad9-b1c1-a0e449ab1f32
This module contains material and energy input, production of waste and emissions for the production of the mentioned FWA (fluorescent whitening agent). Transport and infrastructure have been estimated.
Location: data from European main producer, used as European average
Technology: Typcial production process for end of 90s
Time period: year of reported data
Production volume: 150000000
Sampling: aggregated data, calculated by the producing company itself 
Extrapolations: see geography and technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a4fa1bb7-e42e-3ad9-b1c1-a0e449ab1f32.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
